WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.970
In July we usually go down to San Diego

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:05.540
for a week of shows at Comic-Con.

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:08.080
Obviously, this year
Comic-Con did not happen

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.290
because of COVID.

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:13.530
However, that did not
stop our friends at Funko,

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.890
the company that makes Pop! vinyl figures,

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:17.640
from once again creating

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:22.640
five new limited edition
Conan Pop! figures.

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:26.110
Yes, five. Check 'em out.

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:31.053
There is yours truly as
Wonder Woman right there.

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:34.370
Got the lasso and everything.

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:35.810
You've got...

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:36.973
Oh, this is cool.

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:40.240
Conan as Chucky,

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:43.810
which sadly just looks like me.

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:45.490
Yeah.
No real difference.

00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:47.290
Mini-Conan.
Yeah.

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:48.123
Here's

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:51.943
Conan as Marty McFly.

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:55.460
Yes. That's a good one.

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:56.870
You gotta have that one.

00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:57.703
Here's

00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:00.890
Conan as Aquaman.

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:03.680
I'm fierce in this one. I've
got a trident and everything.

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:06.333
Yeah. Look out, he'll swim at ya.

00:01:06.333 --> 00:01:08.916
(Conan laughs)

00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:13.350
And then look at this sexy pose.

00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:16.890
Conan as Dr. Ian Malcolm.

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:18.870
Look at that.

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:20.880
That is a sensual doll.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.420
Oh, is that like the Jeff Goldblum thing?

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:23.697
Yeah, Jeff Goldblum.

00:01:23.697 --> 00:01:24.850
"Jurassic Park."
He's gonna be pissed.

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:27.810
Look at that. And guess what?

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:31.253
This is now the second-most
sensual doll I own.

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:34.130
Oh boy.

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:36.910
Okay, these are collectible vinyl figures

00:01:36.910 --> 00:01:38.640
that we normally give out at Comic-Con.

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:41.510
Instead we're giving
them away to our viewers

00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:43.550
over the next two weeks.

00:01:43.550 --> 00:01:46.900
A special code will be shown
each night during "Conan."

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:49.132
To enter, go to TBS.com/conanpop,

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:54.340
enter that night's code, see
if you're an instant winner.

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:56.640
Fans also have a second chance to win

00:01:56.640 --> 00:02:00.430
by following Team Coco on
Instagram, Facebook and Twitter.

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:02.610
Gang, you gotta get these.

00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:05.070
Think of it: someday your family

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:09.060
is gonna have to remove these
from your house after you die

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:10.960
and find some use for them.

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:11.823
It's exciting.

